      *                                                                 01110003
      * -------------------------------------------------------------- *01120004
      * Evaluating input table version.                                 01130004
      *                                                                 01140004
           Evaluate True                                                01150003
             When R115L080-In-Work                                      01160009
               Continue                                                 01170003
      *                                                                 01180003
             When other                                                 01190003
               Initialize                   R7918030-ErrorMessage       01200030
