           End-Evaluate                                                 01270003
      *                                                                 01280000
      * -------------------------------------------------------------- *01290004
      * Checking Part Amount Sequence Number.                           01300008
      *                                                                 01310008
           If not R115L080-In-PA-Seq-No  >     +0                       01320008
               Initialize                   R7918030-ErrorMessage       01330030
               Move 'TF-SY-FUNK-NVALID-ON-MC-VAR1'                      01340030
                                         To R7918030-In-MessageCode     01350008
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key(1) 01360008
               Move  'F115L080'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)01370008
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               01380008
               Move  'C002'              To R7919999-Paragraph          01390008
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       01400008
           End-If                                                       01410008
