      *################################################################*02310008
       D100-List-Charge-Sums.                                           02320008
      *                                                                 02330008
      * Listing charges based on both Main_ and Part_Charge values.     02340031
      *                                                                 02350031
           Initialize                          R115L070-Comp-Charge     02360008
           Set   R115L070-Version        To    True                     02370008
           Set   R115L070-In-Work        To    True                     02380008
           Set   R115L070-In-Add         To    True                     02390008
      *                                                                 02400008
           Move  R115L080-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    R115L070-In-Fin-Inst-ID  02410008
           Move  R115L080-In-Fin-Inst-No To    R115L070-In-Fin-Inst-No  02420008
           Move  R115L080-In-Reg-No      To    R115L070-In-Reg-No       02421055
      *                                                                 02430008
           Move  R115L080-In-Contract-Type                              02440008
                                         To    R115L070-In-Contract-Type02450008
           Move  R115L080-In-Contract-No To    R115L070-In-Contract-No  02460008
      *                                                                 02470008
           Move  R115L080-In-PA-Seq-No   To    R115L070-In-PA-Seq-No    02480008
      *                                                                 02490008
      * Special treatment:                                              02500022
      * For operation type 'Approve-Accept-*', we need to list the      02510022
      * valid charge type for 'Accept-*'.                               02520022
   ndl* Feilretting april 2000                                          02521048
      * For operation type 'Approve-Dispose', we need to list the       02521148
      * valid charge type for 'Dispose'.                                02522048
      *                                                                 02530022
           If  R115L080-In-Operation-Type(1:15)                         02540042
                                         =     'APPROVE-ACCEPT-'        02550042
             Move  R115L080-In-Operation-Type(9:11)                     02560022
                                         To   R115L070-In-Operation-Type02570008
           Else                                                         02580022
              If  R115L080-In-Operation-Type(1:15)                      02581047
                                         =     'APPROVE-DISPOSE'        02582047
                  Move  R115L080-In-Operation-Type(9:7)                 02583047
                                         To   R115L070-In-Operation-Type02584047
              Else                                                      02585047
                  Move  R115L080-In-Operation-Type                      02590047
                                         To   R115L070-In-Operation-Type02600022
              End-If                                                    02610047
           End-If                                                       02611047
      *                                                                 02620008
           Perform D130-Call-LMOD-Comp-Charge                           02630008
           .                                                            02640008
      *################################################################*02650008
       D130-Call-LMOD-Comp-Charge.                                      02660008
