      *################################################################*03310016
       E500-Update-Tables.                                              03320016
      *                                                                 03330016
      * Operation Type = 'ACCEPT-COLL', 'ACCEPT-ELC',                   03340040
      * 'APPROVE-ACCEPT-COLL', 'APPROVE-ACCEPT-ELC'.                    03350040
      *                                                                 03360016
           Evaluate True                                                03370016
             When R115L070-MethCalc-Part-Amount(W-Ind)                  03380016
             When R115L070-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA(W-Ind)                    03390016
               Perform H000-Move-Charge                                 03400016
