       F000-Update-Tables.                                              03480008
      *                                                                 03490008
      * Operation Type = 'SETTLE-ILC'.                                  03500008
      *                                                                 03510008
           Evaluate True                                                03520043
             When R115L070-Charge-ROle-Type(W-Ind)                      03530043
                                         =     'CUSTM'                  03540043
             and  R115L070-Credit-Own-Bank(W-Ind)                       03550043
      * These charges would normally have been moved at                 03560044
      * 'ACCEPT-ILC' or 'APPROVE-ACCEPT-ILC',                           03570044
      * but in case of an amendment having occured in the               03580044
      * mean time, the process is repeated.                             03590044
               Perform H000-Move-Charge                                 03600044
      *                                                                 03610043
             When other                                                 03620043
               Perform H000-Move-Charge                                 03630043
      *                                                                 03640043
           End-Evaluate                                                 03650043
           .                                                            03660008
