      *      Move Zero                   To    WS-Charge-Percent        03860050
      *                                                                 03870008
             Perform H100-Update-Part-Charge                            03880008
   ndl* Feilretting 09.07.01                                            03880151
   ndl* Flytter ikke omk av type pct-of-pa, unntatt ved accept ILC      03880251
   ndl* Feilretting 29.08.01                                            03880353
   ndl* Må flytte dem allikevel                                         03880453
      *      If   R115L070-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA(W-Ind)                    03881054
      *      And  NOT WS-Accept-ILC                                     03882054
      *      And  WS-Charge-Percent > 0                                 03882154
      *           Continue                                              03883054
      *      Else                                                       03884054
                  Perform H200-Update-Main-Charge                       03890051
      *      End-If                                                     03891054
      *                                                                 03900008
           End-If                                                       03910008
           .                                                            03920008
